Section: 3 EXPERIMENTS
Text: Q-Q Matching One starting point behind our work is that the query-bag matching may work better than the Q-Q matching for the information-seeking conversation. To verify such opinion, we propose the Q-Q matching based baseline and compare our model with two instances of the baseline. We extract the query-question pairs form the query-bag pair. The label of the query-bag pair is assigned to the new query-question pairs.

