Section: 4 RESULTS AND ANALYSIS
Text: In AliMe dataset, the query-bag matching outperforms the Q-Q matching based methods which shows the necessity to perform query-bag matching. The ablation study shows that the mutual coverage component and bag representation component achieve better performance than the base model, especially in the Quora dataset. The two components work independently and their combination gets the best performance.

