Section: 1 INTRODUCTION
Text: To our knowl- edge, there is no query-bag matching study exists, and we focus on the new approach in this paper. Recalling the text matching task [7], recently, researchers have adopted the deep neural network to model the matching relation- ship. ESIM [2] judges the inference relationship between two sen- tences by enhanced LSTM and interaction space. SMN [6] performs the context-response matching for the open-domain dialog system.

